// gives up on reading it. It is far past anything a document means -- float64
// stops at 308 -- and far short of where the arithmetic below would wrap.
//
// Refused rather than clamped: two literals clamped to one scale would
// canonicalise to one text and a const would then accept a number it forbids,
// which is the whole defect this function exists to close. A refusal falls back
// to the literal as written, which can only ever compare equal to itself.
